---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import QuoteForm from "../components/QuoteForm.astro";
---
<Layout modern title="Golf Cart Rental Prices in The Villages | Plan Your Rental" description="Choose a 2, 4 or 6-passenger golf cart for your stay in The Villages. Compare rental options, prepare your dates and request a complete quote.">
<article class="guide"><header class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="kicker"><span></span> Golf cart rentals / The Villages</p><h1>Your stay.<br/>Your pace.<br/><em>Your cart.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">From a week away to a whole season, find a cart that fits your crew and your stay.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#choose-cart">Explore the carts <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#quote">Request a quote</a></div><p class="hero-footnote">2, 4 &amp; 6 passengers <span>•</span> Weekly &amp; monthly options</p></div><figure class="hero-photo"><img src="/cart-images/hero-villages.webp" alt="Golf cart beside a shaded Florida path" width="1080" height="1350" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>Make room for your time here.</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></figure></div></header><div class="planning-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>LET’S PLAN YOUR RENTAL</span><a href="#choose-cart">01 &nbsp; Choose your seats</a><a href="#plan-stay">02 &nbsp; Set your dates</a><a href="#quote-details">03 &nbsp; Check your quote</a></div></div>
<section id="choose-cart" class="section"><div class="wrap"><span class="step">01 / CHOOSE YOUR CART</span><h2>Good company. The right number of seats.</h2><p class="lead">Start with the number of passengers, then tell us what else you’ll carry. Passenger seats do not necessarily provide space for luggage or equipment.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><img src="/cart-images/2-passenger-1.jpg" alt="2-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><span class="card-label">YOUR RENTAL OPTIONS</span><h3>2 passengers</h3><p>For one or two people. Tell us if you also need space for golf bags or other equipment.</p><a href="/2-passenger-deluxe-golf-cart/">See the 2-passenger cart</a></div></article><article class="card"><img src="/cart-images/4-passenger-1.jpg" alt="4-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><span class="card-label">YOUR RENTAL OPTIONS</span><h3>4 passengers</h3><p>For up to four people. Consider everyone riding together when choosing your cart.</p><a href="/4-passenger-deluxe-golf-cart/">See the 4-passenger cart</a></div></article><article class="card"><img src="/cart-images/6-passenger-1.jpg" alt="6-passenger rental golf cart" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy"/><div class="card-body"><span class="card-label">YOUR RENTAL OPTIONS</span><h3>6 passengers</h3><p>For up to six people. For a larger group, ask about availability for multiple carts.</p><a href="/6-passenger-golf-cart/">See the 6-passenger cart</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section id="plan-stay" class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="step">02 / PLAN YOUR STAY</span><h2>Your dates matter.</h2><p>Request pricing for your exact arrival and departure dates. A weekly package divided by seven is not necessarily a daily rate you can book for a shorter stay.</p><div class="links"><a href="/weekly-golf-cart-rental-villages/">Weekly rentals</a><a href="/monthly-golf-cart-rental-villages/">Monthly rentals</a></div></div><div><h3>Staying longer or planning ahead?</h3><p>Still waiting for your vacation address? Share your dates and neighborhood, and let the team know the exact address is pending.</p><a href="/snowbird-golf-cart-rental/">Planning a seasonal stay</a><p>Need to extend an existing rental? Contact the team before your scheduled return to check availability and the additional cost.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="quote-details" class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="step">03 / CHECK THE TOTAL</span><h2>Compare the whole quote.</h2><p>Pricing depends on the cart, dates, length of rental and delivery arrangements. Ask for the total for your booking, with any applicable charges explained.</p><a href="/contact/">Request availability and pricing</a></div><aside class="note"><h3>Before you reserve, confirm:</h3><ul><li>Rental charge and minimum rental period</li><li>Delivery, pickup and any fuel charges</li><li>Taxes and any payment-related fees</li><li>Deposit, payment and cancellation terms</li><li>Delivery timing and who to call for help</li></ul></aside></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Before you book.</h2><details><summary>How do I get a price for my rental?</summary><p>Call (352) 306-4409 or send a request with your dates, passenger count and delivery area. Ask the team to confirm availability and a complete quote for those details.</p></details><details><summary>Can I ask about a rental without an exact delivery address?</summary><p>Yes. Share the neighborhood or area you expect to stay in and explain that the address is pending. The team can discuss what information is needed before confirming your reservation and delivery.</p></details><details><summary>What if I’m booking for a group?</summary><p>Tell us the total number of people, how many carts you need, and whether you need to carry equipment. For events, include the venue and delivery and pickup windows so the team can discuss arrangements.</p></details></div></section>
<footer class="closing"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready to check your dates?</h2><p>Bring your plans. We’ll help you work through the cart and booking details.</p><a class="button" href="tel:+13523064409">Call (352) 306-4409</a></div></footer></article><QuoteForm heading="Tell us about your stay." intro="Share your dates and cart needs. We’ll follow up to discuss availability and pricing." formName="quote-pricing" hiddenContext={{ "source-page": "pricing" }} />
</Layout><style>
